#: ../../source/docs/ros-data-from-ap.rst:4 f9b18fdc640d474ea6909775a5912577
msgid "Data from AP to ROS"
msgstr "从 ArduPilot 到 ROS 的数据"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-data-from-ap.rst:6 a3fc2bfe410e4ed2ac52c7b0785b8d43
msgid ""
"Mavros consumes MAVLink sensor data messages from ArduPilot and places the "
"data within the /mavros/ topic"
msgstr "Mavros 消费来自 ArduPilot 的 MAVLink 传感器数据消息，并将数据放入 /mavros/ 话题"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-data-from-ap.rst:9 ed5b07049cf646dc84f86dd41d0915f5
msgid "IMU data"
msgstr "IMU 数据"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-data-from-ap.rst:11 284141b3242a4bfbb776e42bcc754a7c
msgid ""
"ArduPilot sends accelerometer, gyro and compass (aka \"mag\") data to "
"ROS/mavros using MAVLink's `RAW_IMU "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#RAW_IMU>`__ message."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 使用 MAVLink 的 `RAW_IMU "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#RAW_IMU>`__ 消息向 ROS/mavros "
"发送加速度计、陀螺仪和罗盘（即「mag」）数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-data-from-ap.rst:13 bbe6a4b03cfb4689be26c0ad54917d06
msgid "mavros consumes this data and places it within the following topics:"
msgstr "mavros 消费这些数据并将其放入以下话题："

#: ../../source/docs/ros-data-from-ap.rst:15 bbfb86301ced4069b384c7647c498084
msgid ""
"/mavros/imu/data and /mavros/imu/data_raw hold the accelerometer (called "
"\"linear_acceleration\") and gyro (called \"angular_velocity) data"
msgstr ""
"/mavros/imu/data 和 /mavros/imu/data_raw "
"包含加速度计（称为「linear_acceleration」）和陀螺仪（称为「angular_velocity」）数据"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-data-from-ap.rst:16 3ed615217a0c40a58a4790f678853238
msgid ""
"/mavros/imu/mag holds the compass data.  This may be all zero if AP's "
"COMPASS_USE parameters have been set to zero"
msgstr "/mavros/imu/mag 包含罗盘数据。若 ArduPilot 的 COMPASS_USE 参数设为零，此处可能全为零"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-data-from-ap.rst:19 04a32bf92ce842bfbb64113fdc3abf31
msgid "Checking and setting the data rate"
msgstr "检查和设置数据速率"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-data-from-ap.rst:25 36bdb08cdb6b4c688999089a3c129c9b
msgid ""
"Run the following command to view the accelerometer and gyro data and update"
" rate on the companion computer running ROS"
msgstr "在运行 ROS 的伴飞计算机上运行以下命令，查看加速度计和陀螺仪数据及更新速率"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-data-from-ap.rst:32 e5c67f2da94749eeae95bdccaf50a690
msgid ""
"mavros can be used to send a command to ArduPilot to change the rate of the "
"data as shown below"
msgstr "可使用 mavros 向 ArduPilot 发送命令以更改数据速率，如下所示"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-data-from-ap.rst:40 7d46f182c3594bcaa14d46fbdd78e9bb
msgid ""
"From within ArduPilot the default update rate of the IMU data sent to "
"ROS/mavros can be set by changing the SRx_EXTRA1 parameter (where \"x\" is "
"normally the serial port number on the flight controller)"
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中，可通过修改 SRx_EXTRA1 参数（其中「x」通常为飞控上的串口编号）设置发送到 ROS/mavros 的 IMU "
"数据默认更新速率"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-data-from-ap.rst:44 6c01bba78b6745bb8f4205d12e401c66
msgid ""
"Users of :ref:`APSync <apsync-intro>` may notice that `APWeb "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/APWeb>`__ resets the data stream rates to 4hz "
"every 10 seconds.  This is a `known issue "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/APWeb/issues/15>`__ that can be worked around "
"by editing the /etc/rc.local file and commenting out the line that starts "
"APWeb."
msgstr ""
":ref:`APSync <apsync-intro>` 用户可能会注意到 `APWeb "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/APWeb>`__ 每 10 秒将数据流速率重置为 4Hz。这是一个 `已知问题 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/APWeb/issues/15>`__，可通过编辑 /etc/rc.local "
"文件并注释掉启动 APWeb 的行来解决。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-data-from-ap.rst:48 7ee19a99ba19485d87d42541a69df224
msgid ""
"If you notice AP is sending data at a higher rate than requested it may be "
"because of `this issue "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/9878>`__"
msgstr ""
"若发现 ArduPilot 以高于请求的速率发送数据，可能是由于 `此问题 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/9878>`__"
